From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Filer v71 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:26:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 139/142] Filer v71: the bar, the title island, Move as a held
 row, search scope

Desktop and compact: Back, Forward | Search <folder> | Grid, List, Columns as
the bar's own buttons (the chosen one raised) | Information | New folder. A
selection: the file's chip (its face; x clears it), Open, Copy, Share,
Information, and ... growing the bar.

Phone (under 560): Search, New folder, and ... growing View (two tiles) and
Sort by (choices with the order's arrow; the same key again flips it, Date
and Size start descending). A selection: Copy, Share, Move, Details, ..., x.
Share is the kit's SharePanel; Details grows the details pane into the bar.
Move holds the files in a second row of the bar ("Where are we moving
this?"); folders still open; Move here moves them (fixture mode only says
so). Search covers the folder by default; while typing, choices above the
field switch to Everywhere (Home). No column view on a phone. The title
island names the place (menu | Home / 6 items) or the folder (back | Launch
/ Projects . 14 items) and is the sidebar's menu (it grows into Places); the
page heading steps aside. No sidebar toggle in the desktop title row; F9
still toggles the sidebar. The phone breakpoint is 559 (the v71 tiers). The
heading's count is refreshed once the folder is counted.
