+ * Desktop and compact: Back, Forward | Search | Grid, List, Columns (the
+ * chosen one raised), Information | New folder. A selection: the file's chip
+ * (✕ clears it), Open, Copy, Share, Information, ⋯.
+ * Phone (under 560): Search, New folder, ⋯ (View and Sort by grow from it).
+ * A selection: Copy, Share, Move, Details, ⋯, ✕, spread across the width.
